[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1011","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0911","title":"Horde IMP 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0911是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0911"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:44.810","remediation":"立即升级 Horde IMP 至 2.2.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 attachment_name 隐藏表单变量未经验证即用于读取和发送任意文件的安全缺陷。升级前可临时缓解：在 Web 服务器层面限制 IMP 附件处理路径的文件系统读取权限，仅允许访问必要的邮件附件目录，并禁用不必要的文件上传功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/82088","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1679","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5227","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d2be4eb036a20db5be632f5ca0ba66a631c4d156/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0911.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0911","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0911.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f59a7fbf5b47ecd49b181f13f4091ea609ec99d4/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0911.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/458762a518138a26e597ac195eb82ce6c30238eb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vg6v-439r-vr4v/GHSA-vg6v-439r-vr4v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0911.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0911.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7e7bb05d-6cea-49c0-8ea7-c61228f3797f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1010","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0910","title":"Horde 电子邮件库 代码执行漏洞","description":"Horde library 1.02 存在命令注入漏洞，因未对邮件头中\"from\"地址的 shell 元字符进行安全过滤，攻击者可利用该缺陷执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响使用 Horde 1.02 的邮件处理系统，攻击条件为攻击者能够向系统提交包含恶意构造内容的发件人地址。利用方式为在\"from\"字段中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等），经系统调用传递后触发命令执行，可能导致服务器被完全控制。建议升级至修复后的版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0910"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:44.680","remediation":"建议将受影响的软件升级到厂商发布的最新安全版本，或根据官方安全公告应用相应的安全补丁。如暂无补丁，建议采取临时缓解措施限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0051.html","http://ssl.coc-ag.de/sec/hordelib-1.2.0.frombug.patch","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000910","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1674","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5278","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7018a2a234cd62e492f0cf2df63817c94e1709c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0910.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0910","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5b8e42e52f83e2552b7e94b219a7aa0de5be1788/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0910.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475589cb6dfc4c0769e0b0658bf8d09e7540c3b5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0910.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vhg7-5jgw-r69v/GHSA-vhg7-5jgw-r69v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0910.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0910.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f42c16d8-7dc7-46f1-bf57-7d4d15c0dabf.json","https://github.com/l/debian-webwml/blob/80cd9461d384c50e61f7c585e566ce9d00c113fc/webwml/english/security/2000/20000910.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1007","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0907","title":"Eserv Eserv 2.92 Build 2982 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"EServ 2.92 Build 2982 邮件服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未授权攻击者可通过发送超长的 HELO 和 MAIL FROM SMTP 命令触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务拒绝服务甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 EServ 2.92 Build 2982 版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程发送畸形 SMTP 命令触发漏洞，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），影响机密性、完整性和可用性。攻击者可通过网络远程发送超长 SMTP 命令触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务崩溃或潜在的任意代码执行。建议升级至修复版本或限制 SMTP 服务访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0907"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:44.277","remediation":"升级eserv到最新可用版本，建议使用2000-2001年间发布的正式补丁版；启用命令长度限制，配置HELO和MAIL FROM命令最大接受字节数为256以下；部署反轰击防护，限制单个IP连接速率并设置超时时间；使用防火墙规则过滤异常长命令，部署流量整形设备缓解攻击影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q3/0131.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0907.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0907","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0907.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0907.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vcvr-wwhg-c72q/GHSA-vcvr-wwhg-c72q.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0907.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88504/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--038df187-339d-45c8-802f-c0614e2ebf9b.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1005","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0905","title":"QNX Voyager Web Server 2.01B 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 QNX Voyager 网页服务器的嵌入式资源管理器中。该管理器中的一个组件未能正确验证用户请求，使得未经身份验证的攻击者能够通过特定的嵌入式 HTML 网页访问敏感的系统统计信息。攻击者只需向目标系统发送简单的 HTTP 请求，就能够读取包含系统详细信息的页面，导致系统敏感信息泄露。受影响的系统包括安装了 QNX 405 演示磁盘并启用 Voyager 网页服务器的 QNX 嵌入式设备。攻击难度较低，远程无需任何权限即可利用此漏洞。攻击者可以利用读取到的系统统计信息进一步对目标进行侦察，为后续攻击收集情报。该漏洞被评定为中危（CVSS 5.0），直接影响了系统的保密性。微软（QNX）已在安全更新中修复了这一漏洞，建议立即对受影响的系统进行补丁升级。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0905"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:43.980","remediation":"立即从 Voyager Web 服务器根目录删除 embedded.html 文件，消除信息泄露路径。将 QNX 4.05 升级至更新的 QNX 版本，并将演示光盘自带的 Voyager Web 服务器更换为生产级 HTTP 服务，同时在防火墙中禁止外部访问系统统计信息页面，仅暴露必要的业务端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/79956","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1648","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0905.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0905","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0905.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0905.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mr8j-g9gr-mgwq/GHSA-mr8j-g9gr-mgwq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0905.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1648/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0905.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1005.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1005.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1004","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0902","title":"phpphotoalbum 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"PhotoAlbum 0.9.9 版本之前的 getalbum.php 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过构造包含 \"..\" 序列的请求参数，利用目录遍历漏洞读取服务器上任意文件内容。该漏洞影响 PhotoAlbum 0.9.9 之前版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，仅需构造包含目录遍历序列的恶意请求参数即可读取服务器敏感文件，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N），主要影响机密性。官方已在 0.9.9 版本修复该漏洞，建议升级至 0.9.9 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0902"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:43.583","remediation":"建议立即升级到 PhotoAlbum 0.9.9 或更高版本，应用官方安全补丁以修复 getalbum.php 中的目录穿越漏洞。可选的临时缓解措施包括在 Web 服务器配置中禁用对包含 .. 路径的访问，或限制 PHP 文件的操作权限至 albums 目录。升级是彻底解决该漏洞的最有效方法，建议立即实施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/80858","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5209","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0902.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0902","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6bd2f3671962f9ee453128567db1f722844715d5/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0902.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0902.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cxgx-xwjv-23mh/GHSA-cxgx-xwjv-23mh.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0902.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88436/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/cc487166cab94617b97cf80718e7bd465592df03/2000.tsv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0902.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1003","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0900","title":"thttpd thttpd 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"thttpd 轻量级 Web 服务器 2.19 及更早版本中的 ssi CGI 程序存在目录遍历漏洞。程序未对用户提交的路径参数进行严格过滤和边界校验，攻击者可利用 URL 编码的 \"%2e%2e\"（即 \"..\" 的编码形式）替代传统的 \"..\" 路径穿越序列，绕过访问控制机制读取服务器上任意文件。该漏洞影响所有启用 ssi CGI 功能且运行受影响版本的 thttpd 服务器，攻击者无需任何身份验证即可通过网络远程发起利用。攻击者只需构造包含特殊编码路径穿越字符的特制 HTTP 请求发送至目标服务器，即可通过 ssi CGI 程序获取目标系统上的敏感文件内容，导致信息泄露风险。此漏洞 CVSS v3 评分 7.5，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0900"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:43.280","remediation":"建议立即升级 thttpd 至 2.20 或更高版本以修复 ssi CGI 目录遍历漏洞；若暂时无法升级，请编辑 thttpd.conf 配置文件将 ssi_enabled 设置为 0 禁用 SSI 功能，或在 Web 服务器前部署 WAF 规则拦截包含 %2e%2e 路径穿越字符的请求，同时限制 Web 服务器进程对敏感目录的文件系统读取权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0025.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1737","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5313","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0900.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0900","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0900.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0900.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/thttpd_ssi.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-7jh6-7mg9-3rhf/GHSA-7jh6-7mg9-3rhf.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_600_700.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1807dba1-1a80-4071-8d0e-ac916666047b.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0959","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0959.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0811","title":"Auction Weaver 路径遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Auction Weaver 1.0 至 1.04 版本存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者通过在 username 或 bidfile 表单字段中注入 ..（点点）序列，可突破目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入进行充分的路径过滤与校验，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，导致敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0811"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:31.807","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，官方不再提供安全更新。建议立即升级至其他仍在维护的拍卖系统（如 osCommerce、Magento 等）。如无法替换，需在应用层对 username 和 bidfile 表单字段进行输入过滤，拒绝包含 `..`、`../` 及空字节等路径遍历特征的请求；同时在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置 URL 重写规则，拦截包含 `..` 的请求路径，并限制 Web 进程对文件系统的读取权限为仅必要目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/4053","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1783","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5372","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0811.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0811","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0811.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ad