系统完整性与可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0934"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:48.080","remediation":"升级 Red Hat Linux 至 6.0 及以上版本，或安装 Red Hat 官方提供的 glint 补丁包。临时缓解措施：移除 glint 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/glint），并限制仅受信任用户可执行 glint。避免在多用户环境下使用 glint 管理 RPM 包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-062.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1703","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5271","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0934.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0934","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0934.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0934.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c7fq-6vmf-wx33/GHSA-c7fq-6vmf-wx33.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0934.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f16f8a77389e4bc58a66c9547351335940b7ddb9/2000.tsv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0907.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0905","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0905.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0913","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_rewrite 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 1.3.12 及更早版本中的 mod_rewrite 模块存在任意文件读取漏洞。当配置中的 RewriteRule 目标路径包含正则表达式反向引用时，规则在展开后可能映射到任意文件名；远程攻击者无需身份认证，可构造特制 HTTP 请求触发该规则，从而读取服务器上任意文件内容，造成敏感信息泄露。影响启用了此类重写规则的 Apache 1.3.x 站点，CVSS 2.0 评分 5.0（中危），已在 Apache HTTP Server 1.3.14 中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0913"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:45.083","remediation":"将 Apache HTTP Server 升级至 1.3.14 或更高版本（Apache 1.3 已于 2010 年停止支持，建议迁移至当前受支持的 2.4.x 版本）。如无法立即升级，临时缓解措施：移除或修改所有包含正则表达式反向引用（$N 或 %N）的 RewriteRule 指令，禁止在 RewriteRule 目标中使用正则引用，或临时禁用 mod_rewrite 模块，同时限制 Web 服务器进程对敏感目录和文件的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0352.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0174.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/hp/2000-q4/0021.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-035.0.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-060-2.php3?dis=7.1","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-088.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-095.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1728","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5310","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5419c9ba0951ef73a655362403d12bb8d10fab38274deb3f005816f5%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5f9c22f9c28adbd9f00556059edc7b03a5d5bb71d4bb80257c0d34e4%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f834890708bf6920%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rb9c9f42dafa25d2f669dac2a536a03f2575bc5ec1be6f480618aee10%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread