,"description":"ISC BIND 8.2 至 8.2.2-P6 版本的 named 守护进程在处理 SRV 资源记录查询时存在缺陷，远程未认证攻击者可通过向 DNS 服务器发送特制的 SRV 记录查询请求，触发 named 进程崩溃导致拒绝服务，该漏洞被称为 \"srv bug\"。影响范围涵盖 ISC BIND 8.2 至 8.2.2-P6 所有版本，攻击者只需网络可达 DNS 服务器的 53 端口，无需身份认证即可发起攻击，利用方式为构造恶意 SRV 记录查询包直接发送至目标 DNS 服务器导致服务崩溃拒绝服务，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属于网络远程拒绝服务漏洞，影响 DNS 服务可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0888"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:40.820","remediation":"建议立即升级 ISC BIND 到 8.2.3 或更高版本（如 9.x 系列），或应用 ISC 官方发布的针对 SRV 记录拒绝服务漏洞的补丁补丁。若暂时无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制 DNS 服务器仅允许受信任源 IP 访问 53 端口（TCP/UDP），并在 named.conf 中添加 allow-query { trusted_nets; }; 限制递归查询来源，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/suse/2000-q4/0657.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000338","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000339","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2000:067","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-20.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001112","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-107.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5814","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0888.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0888","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0888.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/aa5f2f0cb1791a7f76244bf9f9a0c7e17c4a2f8d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0888.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-99j3-f38h-jpgx/GHSA-99j3-f38h-jpgx.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659